msgstr "Fikirana CAPTCHA"

msgid "Error has occurred. Please contact to site administrator."
msgstr ""
"Nisy hadisoana nitranga. Mifandraisa amin’ny tompon’andraikitra ao "
"amin’ilay tranonkala azafady."

