"CAPTCHA disabled, Untrusted users won't see the captcha (<a "
"href=\"@settings\">general CAPTCHA settings</a>)."
msgstr ""
"Nesorina ny CAPTCHA, ary ireo mpampiasa tsy itokisana dia tsy hahita "
"ny CAPTCHA (<a href=\"@settings\">fanefetana ankapobeny momba ny "
"CAPTCHA</a>)."

