msgstr ""
"Asehoy ny vaovao momba ny valiny tsy marina amin’ny fitahirizana "
"(log)."

msgid ""
"Report information about wrong responses to the <a "
"href=\":dblog\">log</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tatitra momba ny valinteny diso ao amin’ny <a "
"href=\":dblog\">log</a>."

