"Convert line breaks into HTML (i.e. <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> and "
"<code>&lt;p&gt;</code>)"
msgstr ""
"Ovay ho HTML ireo fiatoana andalana (oh: <code>&lt;br&gt;</code> sy "
"<code>&lt;p&gt;</code>)"

