"The title attribute is used as a tooltip when the mouse hovers over "
"the image."
msgstr ""
"Ny toetra **title** dia ampiasaina ho *tooltip* rehefa mihetsika eo "
"ambonin’ilay sary ny totozy."

msgid "Preview image style"
msgstr "Mijery mialoha ny fomba fijery sary"

msgid "no preview"
msgstr "tsy misy preview"

msgid "The preview image will be shown while editing the content."
msgstr "Haseho ny sary mialoha mandritra ny fanitsiana ilay atiny."

msgid ""
"Image styles commonly provide thumbnail sizes by scaling and cropping "
"images, but can also add various effects before an image is displayed. "
