"Ny ID rohy ao amin’ny menio (mlid) dia ny fanalahidy voalohany isa "
"(integer primary key)."

msgid ""
"The parent link ID (plid) is the mlid of the link above in the "
"hierarchy, or zero if the link is at the top level in its menu."
msgstr ""
"Ny ID an’ilay rohy ray aman-dreny (plid) dia ny mlid an’ilay rohy "
