msgid ""
"A flag to indicate if the link points to a full URL starting with a "
"protocol, like http:// (1 = external, 0 = internal)."
msgstr ""
"Famantarana haneho raha mankany amin’ny URL feno manomboka amin’ny "
"“protocol”, toy ny http://, ilay rohy (1 = ivelany, 0 = anatiny)."

