"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li>Align an image to the left: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image "
"to the center: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"          <li>Align an image to the right: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"       "
"   <li>… and you can apply this to other elements as well: "
"<code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"    </ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p Azonao atao ny mampifanaraka sary, horonan-tsary, teny nalaina "
"(blockquotes) sy ny sisa ho eo ankavia, ankavanana na eo afovoany. "
"Ohatra:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li>Ampifanaraho amin’ny ankavia ny sary: "
"<code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"left\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  "
"<li>Ampifanaraho amin’ny afovoany ny sary: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" "
"data-align=\"center\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>Ampifanaraho amin’ny "
"ankavanana ny sary: <code>&lt;img src=\"\" data-align=\"right\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"  <li>… ary azonao ampiharina amin’ny singa "
"hafa koa izany: <code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-align=\"center\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"</ul>"

