"ao anatin’izany ny filaharan’ny <em>http://</em> na "
"<em>https://</em>. Mila manondro miverina amin’ity tranonkala ity io "
"sehatra io, raha tsy izany dia mety tsy hiseho araka ny tokony ho izy "
"ny votoaty oEmbed efa misy, na mety tsy hiseho mihitsy."

