msgid ""
"Failed to connect to database. The database engine reports the "
"following message: %error.<ul><li>Does the database file "
"exist?</li><li>Does web server have permission to write to the "
"database file?</li>Does the web server have permission to write to the "
"directory the database file should be created in?</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Tsy nahomby ny fifandraisana tamin’ny tahiry (database). Ity no "
"hafatra notaterin’ny motera (engine) an’ilay database: "
"%error.<ul><li>Manana fisiana ve ilay rakitra database?</li><li>Manana "
"alalana ve ny mpizara web (web server) hanoratra ao amin’ilay "
"rakitra database?</li><li>Manana alalana ve ny mpizara web hanoratra "
"ao amin’ilay lahatahiry tokony hamoronana ny rakitra "
"database?</li></ul>"

