msgid ""
"All kind of entities with revision information, e.g. nodes, comments "
"or users."
msgstr ""
"Ireo karazana zavatra (entities) rehetra manana vaovao momba ny "
"fanavaozana (revision), ohatra: lahatsoratra (nodes), fanehoan-kevitra "
