"href=\":href\">PSA-XXXXX</a>)"

msgid "Enable form sharing"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fizarana endrika"

msgid "Enable form sharing for webform nodes"
msgstr "Ampidiro ny fizarana endrika (form) ho an'ireo node webform"

msgid "Shared form theme"
msgstr "Lohahevitra endrika iombonana ho an’ny endrika"

