msgid ""
"Display \"@display\" needs a selected search fields to work properly. "
"See the settings for the Entity Reference Revisions list format."
msgstr ""
"Ny “@display” voatery hampiseho dia mila fisafidianana saha "
"fikarohana mba hiasa tsara. Jereo ireo fanovana ao amin’ny endrika "
"(format) an’ilay lisitra Entity Reference Revisions."

