"Checked @entity_type revisions for orphans: @current of @total in "
"@interval (@deletions deleted)"
msgstr ""
"Nijery ny fanavaozana @entity_type ho an’ireo “orphan”: @current "
"amin’ny @total ao anatin’ny @interval (efa voafafa @deletions)"

