msgstr ""
"Ny habe fanavaozana ataon’ny batch dia ampiasaina rehefa havaozina "
"betsaka ny fametrahana."

msgid "Batch delete size is used when submissions are being cleared."
msgstr ""
"Ny haben’ny famafana amin’ny batch dia ampiasaina rehefa diovina "
"ny “submissions”."

msgid ""
"The (read) more label used to hide/show more information about an "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Ny marika hoe **(Vakio) bebe kokoa** dia ampiasaina hanafina na "
"hampisehoana fanazavana fanampiny momba singa iray."

msgid ""
"If checked, the webform dialog library will be added to every page on "
"your website, this allows any webform to be opened in a modal dialog."
msgstr ""
"Raha voamarika dia ampiarahina amin’ny pejy rehetra ao amin’ny "
"tranokalanao ny tranomboky momba ny kiakan’ny webform. Izany dia "
"ahafahana manokatra izay webform rehetra ao anaty boaty "
"fifampiresahana (modal)."

msgid ""
"Webform specific dialog links will be included on all webform settings "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Hahitana rohy (link) ho an’ireo takelaka fandresen-dahatra manokana "
"ao amin’ny Webform amin’ny endrika fandrindrana Webform rehetra."

msgid "Help title"
msgstr "Fanampiana lohateny"

msgid "Defaults to the element's title"
msgstr "Miverina ho amin'ny lohatenin’ilay singa"

