"The entire element with descriptions without the hash (#) prefixes is "
"passed as variables to the Twig template."
msgstr ""
"Ny singa iray manontolo ahitana ireo famaritana tsy misy ireo "
"mari-pamantarana hash (#) eo am-piandohany dia alefa ho variables ao "
