"Enter a comma-delimited list of attribute names. The first matched "
"text attribute will be used for all custom option text. Leave blank if "
"options text is populated using Twig."
msgstr ""
"Ampidiro lisitr’ireo anarana toetra misaraka amin’ny faingo. Ny "
"toetra lahatsoratra voalohany mifanaraka dia hampiasaina amin’ny "
"safidy lahatsoratra rehetra manokana. Avelao ho banga raha toa ka "
"fenoina amin’ny Twig ny lahatsoratra safidy."

